flowchart TD
    A[Call may have failed] --> B{Did destination state change}
    B -->|Known no| C[Retry only if allowed]
    B -->|Known yes| D[Record completed operation]
    B -->|Unknown| E[Read state before retry]
    E -->|Already complete| D
    E -->|Not complete| F[Retry with same operation identity]
    C --> G[Verify result]
    F --> G
    D --> G
    G --> H{All intended work complete}
    H -->|Yes| I[Close workflow]
    H -->|No| J[Isolate failed items]
    J --> K[Recover only remaining items]

